            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">Target an Enemy model within 3&quot; of a friendly Kaizoku. That model must make a Size Challenge Test (6) or be pushed 3&quot; in any direction and become Prone.</characteristic>
