          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">When an Enemy model with any Enhancement - Equipment cards is removed from play as a result of a Melee Exchange, Attatch those cards to the Friendly model that killed the Enemy model. Tgnore the limit on Equipment, Requirements and Exclusions.</characteristic>
