              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">While Prone this model may declare the Wait Action instead of the Stand Up Action (Even if in BtB with an Enemy model) and it gains +1 Ki Stat, Armour (3) and Durable until it loses the Prone State.

This model may not declare Special Attacks or Defences while Prone.

If this model uses its Scout trait, it begins the game Prone with 2 Ki Tokens.</characteristic>
