                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When this model is the active model and in BtB with an Enemy model, the Enemy model must make a Move Challenge Test (6). If it fails, place this model Elsewhere and the Enemy model gains the following traits: Unstable, Weak (Melee), Slow. The model may take a Wait Action. If it does, or if the model is killed, it loses the traits and it&apos;s Controller may place this model from Elsewhere to witin 2&quot; of the Enemy model.</characteristic>
