          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="c40b-3106-986d-4db5">30mm</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Passage" typeId="3df8-6a47-0c4d-73e7">Impassable</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Visibility" typeId="9858-c2c1-b6fc-b75c">Blocking</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Size" typeId="000a-cf92-4d1e-c934">Small</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="eaef-482b-c5d3-866e">Destructible</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9cfa-9bd0-0b1b-9c06">During Deployment, place 3 Loot Tokens on this card.
A model in BtB with this Terrain Element at the end of its activation may choose one of the following once per activation:
- Remove a Loot Token to add an Ammo Token to that model.
- Remove a Loot Token from this card to remove a Reload Marker on that model.
- Remove a Loot Token on this card to attach a Permitted Enhancement - Equipment card to the model. The card must cost 1 Rice or fewer.
This terrain element must be placed within 6&quot; of the centreline and not within 3&quot; of a board edge.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
