      <profiles>
        <profile name="Benthic Servitude" id="3a55-4c05-0625-7fec" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- Once per game, in the Starting Phase declare the use of this ability. All of Keikoku&apos;s listed Ki Feats (excluding Boosts) are reduced to Cost: Zero.
- Ranged Weapons in this Warband that have Strength Sp gain Brutal (1).

Kancho: Keikoku
Juhin: Mitsukurina

Permitted [Jung models, Ronin Kami, Ronin Yokai]
Exclusion [Other Kancho or Juhin than those listed, Buto, Kaizoku, Mother of the Pearl]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="The Deep" id="c0d2-f3cb-e3b1-ffaf" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
