      <profiles>
        <profile name="The Deep" id="62b3-4c6f-15f5-a30b" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- The Red Pearl Event costs 0 Rice to Recruif to this Warband.
- Friendly Faction models gain Ranged Defence (+ 1) against Enemy Ranged Attacks.
- In the Starting Phase, choose a Friendly Deep model. That model gains Terror until the End Phase.
- Once per game, in the Starting Phase, place a 5&quot; circular [Normal, Clear, Zero] Terrain Element centered on each Friendly [Water Element] Kami on the Battlefield. Enemy models treat this Terrain Element as Diffcult. Models with [Fire Element] lose one Activation Counter if they are in the area of the Terrain Element when it is placed.

Kancho: Jung Keikoku
Juhin: Mitsukurina

Permitted [Jung models, Ronin Asura, Ronin Kami, Ronin Yokai]
Exclusion [Other Kancho or Juhin than those listed, Buto, Kaizoku]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
