              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">If this model is Killed in a Melee Exchange, the opposing model is Replaced by Summoning a Friendly Miyakomo&apos;s Echo into this model&apos;s Warband.
