            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9cfa-9bd0-0b1b-9c06">This terrain must be deployed within 3&quot; of the centreline.
While Friendly Kaizoku models are completely within the half of the battlefield (divided by the centreline) containing your deployment area, those models generate one additional Ki Token during Ki Generation.

While Friendly Kaizoku models are completely within the other half of the battlefield, when declaring a Walk, Run or Melee action, those models may gain +1 Move until the end of  the current Activation.
If they do they must move toward their Deployment area.</characteristic>
