              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When this model declares a Walk, Run, Melee or Charge Action, once its move is complete it makes a Ranged Attack against each other model (Friendly and Enemy) in Range and LoS, in any order.
These attacks are not affected by the penalty for having made Ranged Attacks previously in the turn.
It may perform these Ranged Attacks even while in BtB with an Enemy model or in an Enemy model&apos;s ZoC.

This model may not declare Ranged Attack Actions.</characteristic>
