            <profile name="Fu Ran Ku" id="8667-849e-89be-ccc4" hidden="false" typeId="b175-cf39-0ab9-4d58" typeName="Character Traits">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="6fb8-4540-ed80-9332">Aware, Cloudwalk, Durable, Endurance, Immune [Control, Stun], Ranged Defence (1), Sixth Sense</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
        <infoGroup name="Unique Effects" id="9861-da7c-df90-1124" hidden="false">
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Fu Ran Ku" id="9051-1209-8b8c-cccc" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model cannot gain Scout or Flank.
This model cannot declare Melee or Charge Actions.
This model may not have Equipment attached.
Enemy models in BtB with this model in the Starting Phase generate one fewer Activation Counters.
Before or after this model performs any action it may Move 3&quot;.
Once per activation, when this model Enters BtB with an Enemy model or an Enemy model Enters into BtB with this model, that Enemy model gains an Immobilised Marker after the activation is resolved.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="All-knowing" id="06d3-0d3f-e933-f4f0" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">In the End Phase, if this model is BtB with any Enemy models, those model&apos;s owners must reveal if those models are their VIM.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Analyse" id="8080-a9d0-0744-5edb" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">Enemy models in BtB with this model cannot be nominated to take the Tactical Test.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Conclusion" id="0cf6-6bac-62ed-b81b" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When a Friendly Kancho or Juhin model activates, the opposing player must declare which model they will choose as their next Activating model.
If the model becomes ineligible before it is chosen as the Activating model then another model can be chosen without restriction.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
      </infoGroups>
