        <profile name="The 64th Fleet" id="34a9-1ba3-a4a8-9a53" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">Kancho: Jung Sen&apos;in
Juhin: Tatakai


- Kaizoku in the Warband gain Armour (+1).
- While Performing any Action using a Friendly model&apos;s Command Trait, Kaizoku in the Warband gain +1 to their Melee, Ranged, and Ki Statistics.
- In the Starting Phase, profiles on one Friendly Kaizoku card may gain Group and Coordinated Attack [Kaizoku].


Permitted: [Jung models, Ronin Hiroto, Ronin Kenmeina]
Exclusion: [Other Kancho or Juhin than those listed, Crabs, Samemiman]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
